{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.poster.avif?t=1762668293\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.webm?t=1762668293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.mp4?t=1762668293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Hijong Park's Defender Patrol</strong> is a low-poly helicopter combat flight simulator featuring simple but fully interactable cockpit system, playable in both the monitor and Virtual-reality.<br><br>The game aims to be a middle ground between serious study flight simulator and arcade action for light observation helicopter, with a simple low poly graphics that resembles the flight simulators from MS-DOS era. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/94f5921820551a08f069001ea938ac3c.poster.avif?t=1762668293\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/94f5921820551a08f069001ea938ac3c.webm?t=1762668293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/94f5921820551a08f069001ea938ac3c.mp4?t=1762668293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Semi-realistic flight model, which is a lot simpler than real life helicopters but still gives the feeling of riding a helicopter.<br></li><li>Directly interact with switches in the cockpit. You don't need to memorize tons of keybinds!<br></li><li>Offers 3 different play modes for flight sim enthusiasts:<br><ol><li><strong>Flatscreen:</strong> Play in just simple flat screen monitor with joysticks or Keyboard and mouse. Various snap view functions are available to aid your limited vision.<br></li><li><strong>TrackIR:</strong> Use your TrackIR device to quickly look around the cockpit.<br></li><li><strong>VR:</strong> Play with VR controllers alone, or mix some joysticks. Various combos are possible.</li></ol></li><li>Procedurally Generated scenes and missions offering completely unexpectable encounters during your duty!<br></li><li>Equip weapons in each 2 pylons of MD-500MG to destroy things, or carry 4 troops with MD-500E.<br><table><tr><th><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.poster.avif?t=1762668293\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.webm?t=1762668293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.mp4?t=1762668293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></th><th><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.poster.avif?t=1762668293\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.webm?t=1762668293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.mp4?t=1762668293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></th></tr></table></li><li>Encounter various AI units including infantries, MANPADS, stationary turrets, armored cars, tanks, howitzers, and SPAAVs. Kill bad ones, help good ones.<br></li><li>Fly with your AI helicopter wingmen to complete missions, and fight with enemy AI helicopters.<br></li><li>Use ANVIS for night operations.<br></li><li>Out of ammo? Draw your victorious model 10 and keep fighting for your victory.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pilot license obtained","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982130/eaeae4d03ba907bb7b463a78503566a633f99c87.jpg"},{"name":"My little gunship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982130/db2fe602ca0047776026acf7c7845ca48645b04f.jpg"},{"name":"Wired tank killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982130/9e5f21378540be3f4019cd73727e253da82352cb.jpg"},{"name":"FOX TWO but for Army","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982130/33e5017c4a45894dd4abd007e1a1dcc62ec6d9b3.jpg"},{"name":"Multi functional mess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982130/b1088dfa8432712bb656f7bff07ab251a61648df.jpg"},{"name":"So when will we ever get UH-1 ?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982130/1c0709b4165bd5cf6ba36d32dec79a6ebbe3f69c.jpg"},{"name":"MD-500MG mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982130/210a64c3269362b8afe33bc2ba7dd5a667b9f96b.jpg"},{"name":"MD-500E mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982130/2caf1e1400df68351c7ff49b39a520d69102d1c8.jpg"},{"name":"MD-530F mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982130/c9e5a653d3acf2aa0d4d244889b14311d15ff5a1.jpg"},{"name":"Old and reliable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982130/e38c9557ac03417ac1186c59486ae9b8583c23f5.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982130?t=1762668293","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982130?t=1762668293","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/4a776acc1d3a4d772f81ea7c518938cbfecfe7eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762668293","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/4a776acc1d3a4d772f81ea7c518938cbfecfe7eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762668293","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3982140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Supporter Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/0ccc27363ff78e3bd79072cf4b05d28e.avif?t=1762668293\" width=1560 height=600 /></span><br>You can play this game for free, or support us by purchasing the\u00a0<strong>Supporter Edition</strong>. In Supporter Edition, you can pilot <strong>MD-530F Defender</strong>, the upgraded variant of MD-500MG featuring twin minigun pylons and improved engine! Supporter Edition also supports Steam Cloud feature.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.poster.avif?t=1762668293\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.webm?t=1762668293\" type=\"vid