ol></li><li>Procedurally Generated scenes and missions offering completely unexpectable encounters during your duty!<br></li><li>Equip weapons in each 2 pylons of MD-500MG to destroy things, or carry 4 troops with MD-500E.<br><table><tr><th><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.poster.avif?t=1762668293\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.webm?t=1762668293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.mp4?t=1762668293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></th><th><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.poster.avif?t=1762668293\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.webm?t=1762668293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.mp4?t=1762668293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></th></tr></table></li><li>Encounter various AI units including infantries, MANPADS, stationary turrets, armored cars, tanks, howitzers, and SPAAVs. Kill bad ones, help good ones.<br></li><li>Fly with your AI helicopter wingmen to complete missions, and fight with enemy AI helicopters.<br></li><li>Use ANVIS for night operations.<br></li><li>Out of ammo? Draw your victorious model 10 and keep fighting for your victory.</li></ul>","developers":["Hijong Park"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"desc